<title>UK: LME announces Board changes.</title>
<headline>LME announces Board changes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>As a result of a ballot for election of Ring Dealing Members to the Board of Directors of the London Metal Exchange (LME) the following changes were announced in an LME notice.</p>
<p>P.Sellers of Barclays Bank plc, V.Davies of Brandeis (Brokers) Ltd and M.Linington of Billiton Metals Ltd were elected to the Board.</p>
<p>D.Jackman of Sogemin Metals Ltd and R.Kestenbaum were candidates not elected, the LME said.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
